{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（5日）中午12時14分，西灣河太康街45號鯉景灣一間餐廳對開，一名年約40歲男工人懷疑被招牌擊中頭部，當場昏迷。救援人員到場，傷者回復知覺，半清醒送往東區醫院搶救，警方列工業意外展開調查。</p><p>現場消息指，事發時事主在餐廳門口準備拆招牌，其間招牌突然墮下並擊中事主。</p><figure><img alt=\"男工被送往東區醫院搶救。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139553706891546624410623.jpeg/pqe07sukBlw7Ua8GoGzPsxVi5calmf9kWF4vhFheL4Q\"/><figcaption>男工被送往東區醫院搶救。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"餐廳招牌懷疑從高處墮下擊中一名男工。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139554227568381952794852.jpeg/ymEHNu7_V8hrznCbqWYePrQ4f1-ItZu1miPItr8jyLY\"/><figcaption>餐廳招牌懷疑從高處墮下擊中一名男工。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在餐廳調查。（陳佩瑩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139554223646576640014872.jpeg/Vi3yQH4uqXdRrMaPl1CA2jnW2a_Qc6RIi383_q5_N_4\"/><figcaption>警員在餐廳調查。（陳佩瑩攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"男工被送往東區醫院搶救。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139553904250327040649753.jpeg/RAVXaVfgn1X7znTui6HznbanokE6BQBXvywsyL8sLMg\"/><figcaption>男工被送往東區醫院搶救。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139553396928417792038247.jpeg/rAeF2TrKeLU83FVA4PxBx-8utD1QeVVGyxlCke4ZQpE\"/><figcaption>警員在場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"餐廳招牌懷疑從高處墮下擊中一名男工。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139553399688400896924673.jpeg/wv--4G0BliSMf8qUF-l7hMqY7uL-UOns1dKPwvDSj8I\"/><figcaption>餐廳招牌懷疑從高處墮下擊中一名男工。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"傷者送往東區醫院搶救。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250928/1048822589780135936385462.jpeg/lpW9UsSgzByOGXlcpbBMjzZwc1jWtml_fHYd5UZ2HeU\"/><figcaption>傷者送往東區醫院搶救。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-05T05:23:11.989854+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":257,"images":7,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}